  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The logarithm of equilibrium constant for the reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pd</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8652;</mo><msubsup><mi>PdCl</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo></math> is<br />(Nearest integer)</p><p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>Pd</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi>Pd</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>PdCl</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi>Pd</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Using gibbs free energy equation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>RT</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lnK</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>nFE</mi><mtext>cell&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>RT</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>Cell</mtext><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pd</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8652;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pd</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>cathode,&#160;reduction&#160;</mtext><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pd</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>PdCl</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>anode,&#160;oxidation</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Net Reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Pd</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><msub><mi>PdCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>cell&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>cathode,reduction</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>anode, oxidation&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>65</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Also <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Using equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mtext>Cell</mtext><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>logK</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
